Source: zerodds
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ZeroDDS Contributors <release@zerodds.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo (>= 1.88), pkg-config, libssl-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://zerodds.org
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/zero-objects/zero-dds
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/zero-objects/zero-dds.git
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: zerodds-core
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libssl3
Description: ZeroDDS shared library and runtime metadata
 Provides libzerodds.so (ABI v1) plus C-headers, pkg-config and the
 systemd-tmpfiles fragment that creates /var/log/zerodds and
 /var/lib/zerodds. Declared mandatory dependency for every other
 zerodds-* package.
 .
 Cross-Ref: zerodds-deployment-1.0.md §2.1 / §2.2.1.

Package: zerodds-cli
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, zerodds-core (= ${binary:Version})
Description: ZeroDDS administration and diagnostic CLIs (18 tools)
 Ships zerodds-admin, zerodds-bench, zerodds-chaos, zerodds-dashboard,
 zerodds-idlc, zerodds-lint, zerodds-monitor, zerodds-mq, zerodds-pcap,
 zerodds-perf, zerodds-record, zerodds-recorder-bridge, zerodds-replay,
 zerodds-secure-permissions, zerodds-snitch, zerodds-spy,
 zerodds-traceability and zerodds-xmlc. zerodds-ros2-shim is in
 zerodds-ros2.

Package: zerodds-dev
Architecture: any
Depends: zerodds-core (= ${binary:Version})
Description: ZeroDDS C/C++ development files
 Static library, public headers and pkg-config descriptor for building
 against libzerodds. Cross-Ref: zerodds-ffi-loader-1.0 §6.

Package: zerodds-ws-bridge
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, zerodds-core (= ${binary:Version}), adduser, lsb-base (>= 3.0-6)
Description: ZeroDDS DDS to WebSocket bridge daemon
 Spec: zerodds-ws-bridge-1.0 §11 / zerodds-deployment-1.0 §2.

