Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, zerodds-core (= ${binary:Version}), adduser
Description: ZeroDDS DDS to MQTT 5 bridge daemon
 Spec: zerodds-mqtt-bridge-1.0 §11.

Package: zerodds-coap-bridge
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, zerodds-core (= ${binary:Version}), adduser
Description: ZeroDDS DDS to CoAP bridge daemon
 Spec: zerodds-coap-bridge-1.0 §11.

Package: zerodds-amqp-bridge
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, zerodds-core (= ${binary:Version}), adduser
Description: ZeroDDS DDS to AMQP 1.0 bridge daemon
 Spec: zerodds-amqp-bridge-daemon-1.0 §11.

Package: zerodds-grpc-bridge
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, zerodds-core (= ${binary:Version}), adduser
Description: ZeroDDS DDS to gRPC bridge daemon
 Spec: zerodds-grpc-bridge-1.0 §11.

Package: zerodds-corba-bridge
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, zerodds-core (= ${binary:Version}), adduser
Description: ZeroDDS DDS to CORBA GIOP/IIOP bridge daemon
 Spec: zerodds-corba-bridge-1.0 §11.

Package: zerodds-ros2
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, zerodds-core (= ${binary:Version})
Description: ZeroDDS ROS 2 diagnostics (zerodds-ros2-shim)
 zerodds-ros2-shim, which prints what rmw_zerodds_cpp reads from the runtime
 configuration, its man pages and the ros2 drop-in template. The RMW library
 itself is not here: it ships per ROS distro as
 ros-<distro>-rmw-zerodds-cpp, built from the ament package rmw_zerodds_cpp
 (packaging/linux/deb/build-rmw-deb.sh).
 Spec: zerodds-ros2-bridge-1.0 §11.

Package: zerodds-durability
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, zerodds-core (= ${binary:Version})
Description: ZeroDDS Durability-Service daemon
 zerodds-durability-svc keeps TRANSIENT and PERSISTENT samples for late
 joiners, one daemon per domain, with the sqlite or file store
 (see zerodds-durability-svc(1)).

Package: zerodds-naming
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, zerodds-core (= ${binary:Version}), adduser
Description: ZeroDDS OMG CosNaming 1.3 NameService daemon
 zerodds-naming-svc: NamingContext + NamingContextExt + BindingIterator
 over IIOP/SSLIOP, optionally CSIv2 GSSUP, persisted to a file
 (see zerodds-naming-svc(1)).
